@startuml StationContributionVerification
!theme plain
title Station Data Contribution and Verification — Business Process

|#AntiqueWhite|① EV User / Collaborator|
start
:Submit station change request\n(CREATE or UPDATE)|
|#LightYellow|② System|
:Assess risk score|
if (Risk >= 60?) then (High Risk)
  :Flag: requiresVerification|
else (Low/Medium)
endif
:Award +10 loyalty points|

|#AntiqueWhite|② Admin|
:Review → Approve or Reject|
if (Rejected?) then (Yes)
  :Notify user|
  stop
else (Approve)
endif

|#AntiqueWhite|② Admin|
:Publish CR|
if (High Risk?) then (Yes)
  :Create VerificationTask|
  detach
else (No)
  :→ Publish Success|
  detach
endif

|#GhostWhite|④ Collaborator|
:Receive task notification|
:Check-in at station|
|#LightYellow|② System|
if (Within 200m?) is (No)
  :Reject check-in|
  stop
else (Yes)
endif
:Submit evidence + photos|
|#AntiqueWhite|② Admin|
:Review evidence|
if (PASS?) is (No)
  :Flag for re-inspection|
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|== PUBLISH SUCCESS ==|

|#LightYellow|② System|
:Publish new version|
:Recalculate trust score|
:Award +40 loyalty points|
:Notify contributor|
stop

|#GhostWhite|④ Collaborator|
note right
Skip to Publish Success
if low/medium risk
end note

@enduml
